  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Audit Framework Agreement BiH</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Audit Framework Agreement BiH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida&apos;s project and program agreements are regularly audited on an annual basis. The audits are carried out by external, independent, and qualified auditors on behalf of the project or program. In addition to the regular audits, Sida has the right to commission special audits, for which Sida will be the contracting party. The audit needs to ascertain that funding provided by the Swedish government is spent in an appropriate manner. Sida might also commission organizational audits in connection with the preparation and appraisal of a possible support to institutions and organizations. Such audits form an important part of the assessment and provide guidance on the design of the cooperation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sidas projekt- och programavtal revideras varje &#xe5;r. Revisionerna utf&#xf6;rs av externa, oberoende och kvalificerade revisorer p&#xe5; uppdrag av projektet eller programmet. Ut&#xf6;ver de ordinarie revisionerna har Sida r&#xe4;tt att best&#xe4;lla s&#xe4;rskilda revisioner, d&#xe4;r Sida &#xe4;r avtalspart. Revisionen beh&#xf6;vs f&#xf6;r att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla att medel fr&#xe5;n den svenska staten anv&#xe4;nds p&#xe5; ett l&#xe4;mpligt s&#xe4;tt. Sida kan ocks&#xe5; best&#xe4;lla organisationsrevisioner i samband med beredningar av eventuellt st&#xf6;d till institutioner och organisationer. S&#xe5;dana revisioner utg&#xf6;r en viktig del av Sidas bed&#xf6;mning och ger v&#xe4;gledning om utformningen av samarbetet.</narrative>
  </description>
